---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Who am I — taras" description="About Taras">
  <main style="padding: 3rem 1.5rem; max-width: var(--max-width); margin: 0 auto;">
    <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <a href="/" style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-link);">← Back to posts</a>
      <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 0 0;">Who am I</h1>
    </header>

    <section class="prose" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-text);">
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
        Hi, I'm Taras. I love hacking things, and I'm based in beautiful Barcelona.
      </p>

      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
        I write here my thoughts and experiences that I believe can be useful and interesting to others, as they are to me.

        Generally these are related to software, startups, hackathons, and lately AI.
      </p>

      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
        I'm currently building <a href="https://desplega.sh">desplega labs</a> with an amazing co-founder, and we shipped some interesting products like <a href="https://desplega.ai">desplega.ai</a> and <a href="https://agent-swarm.dev">agent-swarm</a>.
      </p>

      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
        Before that I worked at <a href="http://solo.one/">SOLO</a> and <a href="https://capchase.com/">Capchase</a>, where I had the amazing opportunity of working with great people, which some I'm lucky to call friends now.
      </p>

      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
        You can find me on {" "}
        {" "}
        <a href="https://x.com/voidisomorphism">X</a>
        {" "}, {" "}
        <a href="https://github.com/tarasyarema">GitHub</a>.
        {" "}, {" "}
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tarasyarema/">LinkedIn</a>
        {" "}, or {" "}
        via email at <a href="mailto:t@desplega.sh">t@desplega.sh</a>.
      </p>

      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
        If you are interested in the same topics as I am, or just want to say hi, feel free to reach out. I'm always open to connecting with like-minded people and sharing ideas.
      </p>

      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
        Also a proud Ukranian. <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xDeQVaoTvJM">Ще не вмерли України</a>!
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
